{
   "description": "The self-hosted NetBird server: up, peers on management, signal and the relay, logins, peer changes, relay traffic, answer times, API errors and its VM. Managed by anvil: change dashboards/netbird.jsonnet.",
   "editable": false,
   "panels": [
      {
         "datasource": {
            "type": "datasource",
            "uid": "-- Mixed --"
         },
         "gridPos": {
            "h": 3,
            "w": 24,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
         },
         "id": 1,
         "options": {
            "content": "The **self-hosted** network only (the cloud network has no metrics here). **Connected peers** are the devices holding a session with management right now, including `netbird-home`, the lab's routing peer. **Signal** helps two peers find each other, and the **relay** carries a connection when they cannot reach each other directly: relay traffic that stays high means peers are not connecting directly. Answer times are the slowest 5% (p95).\n",
            "mode": "markdown"
         },
         "pluginVersion": "v13.0.0",
         "title": "How to read this",
         "type": "text"
      },
      {
         "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
         },
         "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
               "mappings": [
                  {
                     "options": {
                        "0": {
                           "text": "DOWN"
                        },
                        "1": {
                           "text": "UP"
                        }
                     },
                     "type": "value"
                  }
               ],
               "thresholds": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                     {
                        "color": "red",
                        "value": null
                     },
                     {
                        "color": "green",
                        "value": 1
                     }
                  ]
               },
               "unit": "none"
            }
         },
         "gridPos": {
